---
import DuckSticker from './DuckSticker.astro';
---

<div class="philosophy-container">
<section class="philosophy postcard" aria-labelledby="philosophy-heading">
    <div class="philosophy-copy">
        <h2 id="philosophy-heading">Why "Human-First Design"?</h2>
        <p>
            I love technology, but I love the humans behind it even more. Behind every great
            invention, every small avatar, there is a person.* And I never want us to forget that. 
            So in an age where generative AI drowns out most everything else, I want to 
            champion <strong>human-first design</strong>, preserving the connection between 
            clients and developers.
        </p>
        <p>
            I respect your wishes; if you are okay with the usage of AI to help build your
            website, then I may use it during development. And if you prefer the no-AI approach, I have
            zero problem building your website with nothing but my own two hands (and the MDN documentation
            open in a handy browser tab).
        </p>
        <p>
            I want every client to remember there's a real person behind the screen, 
            a real person who cares about getting your project right. Everything will always receive a human's eye,
            a human's second opinion before delivery.
        </p>
        <p>
            Interested in working together? <a href="/contact">Reach out and let's chat.</a>
        </p>
        <p class="footnote">*For the most part.</p>
    </div>

    <DuckSticker rotate={6} caption="Earl 'Mango' Duckman, quality control" class="duck-sticker" />
</section>
</div>

<style>
    .philosophy-container {
        width: var(--page-content-width);
        margin: 0 0 var(--space-5) auto;
    }
    .philosophy {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: var(--space-4);
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 75%;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: var(--space-4);
    }

    .philosophy-copy {
        width: 70%;
    }

    .footnote {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
        .philosophy-container {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .philosophy {
            width: 90%;
            padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-2);
        }

        .philosophy-copy {
            width: 90%;
        }
    }
</style>
